SUMMARY:70+ Resistance Band Strength Training
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260827T100000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260827T104500
UID:cf9680b768919fabed25ef93199385c1@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:This 45-minute resistance band strength class is for adults 70
 + who want to build strength\, improve balance\, and stay active in a supp
 ortive\, small-group setting. Classes focus on simple\, low-impact movemen
 ts that support everyday mobility and confidence. Exercises are adaptable 
 and meet participants where they are. Resistance bands are provided or you
 ’re welcome to bring your own. Please wear comfortable clothing\, stable
  shoes\, and bring a water bottle. Thursdays at 10:00 AM at Wellness Colle
 ctive $10 per class To sign up\, text Susette at 435-260-2523. Or show up!
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
